Category MIME / extension Max size (default) PDF <code>application/pdf</code>, <code>.pdf</code> 10 MB Images <code>image/jpeg</code>, <code>image/png</code>, <code>image/webp</code> 5 MB Excel <code>.xlsx</code>, <code>.xls</code>, <code>text/csv</code> 25 MB Word <code>.docx</code> 10 MB Generic attachment Configurable per field 10 MB <p>Define per-field in Zod:</p> <pre><code>const receiptSchema = z.object({
  files: z
    .array(z.instanceof(File))
    .min(1, "At least one receipt is required")
    .max(5, "Maximum 5 files")
    .refine(
      (files) =&gt; files.every((f) =&gt; f.size &lt;= 10 * 1024 * 1024),
      "Each file must be under 10 MB",
    )
    .refine(
      (files) =&gt; files.every((f) =&gt;
        ["application/pdf", "image/jpeg", "image/png"].includes(f.type),
      ),
      "Only PDF and images are allowed",
    ),
});
</code></pre>

